{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tangy TD: Tower Defense, Class Based,</strong> <strong>Roguelite</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/2229b987313232f78e7cad6cec5bc4f3.poster.avif?t=1759146977\" width=1170 height=690 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/2229b987313232f78e7cad6cec5bc4f3.webm?t=1759146977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><u>HOW LONG CAN YOU SURVIVE?\u00a0</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tangy TD is a tower defense game where the enemies fight back! Place class based Tangy such as defender, archer and healer to defeat hordes of enemies and level up. Progress through an expansive skill tree to unlock new ways to play and become absurdly powerful. Merge and equip items to discover new mechanics. Explore maps, bosses, map obstacles and recruit new Tangy types to your roster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/8e56574b8f981ea5141ad30f3d1177bc.poster.avif?t=1759146977\" width=1170 height=690 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/8e56574b8f981ea5141ad30f3d1177bc.webm?t=1759146977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend Skillpoints</strong> earned by defeating enemies in a <strong>giant Skilltree</strong> to permanently boost the Tangys power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/08ab5718296634c4c1e1ccb811bdf789.poster.avif?t=1759146977\" width=1170 height=690 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/08ab5718296634c4c1e1ccb811bdf789.webm?t=1759146977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find strong combinations of items and skills to create the most powerful Tangys and defend their homeland from the evil, very evil... rat infestation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four classes with unique skill sets. Defender, Archer, Healer and Mage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Skill Tree for each class to progress through to unlock abilities and grow more powerful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode. Test your strategy against waves of enemies that become exponentially more difficult.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Music by: NecropolisAD</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2245620?t=1759146977","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/230557bc22322e67aaa3b761f3474843001b481e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759146977","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/31727e34885137d378f80b0300940d7597ab2307/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759146977","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/31727e34885137d378f80b0300940d7597ab2307/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759146977","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2248860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tangy TD: Tower Defense, Class Based,</strong> <strong>Roguelite</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/2229b987313232f78e7cad6cec5bc4f3.poster.avif?t=1759146977\" width=1170 height=690 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/2229b987313232f78e7cad6cec5bc4f3.webm?t=1759146977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><u>HOW LONG CAN YOU SURVIVE?\u00a0</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tangy TD is a tower defense game where the enemies fight back! Place class based Tangy such as defender, archer and healer to defeat hordes of enemies and level up. Progress through an expansive skill tree to unlock new ways to play and become absurdly powerful. Merge and equip items to discover new mechanics. Explore maps, bosses, map obstacles and recruit new Tangy types to your roster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/8e56574b8f981ea5141ad30f3d1177bc.poster.avif?t=1759146977\" width=1170 height=690 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/8e56574b8f981ea5141ad30f3d1177bc.webm?t=1759146977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend Skillpoints</strong> earned by defeating enemies in a <strong>giant Skilltree</strong> to permanently boost the Tangys power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/08ab5718296634c4c1e1ccb811bdf789.poster.avif?t=1759146977\" width=1170 height=690 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/08ab5718296634c4c1e1ccb811bdf789.webm?t=1759146977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find strong combinations of items and skills to create the most powerful Tangys and defend their homeland from the evil, very evil... rat infestation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four classes with unique skill sets. Defender, Archer, Healer and Mage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Skill Tree for each class to progress through to unlock abilities and grow more powerful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode. Test your strategy against waves of enemies that become exponentially more difficult.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Music by: NecropolisAD</h2>","developers":["Cakez"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/cceb12c3b520abd84ac2c22e25df1febcd4ac693/header.jpg?t=1759146977","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2245620/1884486026/3f52b376370424ac5781bc2b3cae4bc420c151df/1758645791/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758704629","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2245620/1884486026/3f52b376370424ac5781bc2b3cae4bc420c151df/